# Template for the production-literal denylist used by tests/validate_package.py.
#
# Copy this file to tests/forbidden-literals.txt (which is gitignored) and fill it
# with the real production-specific values that must never appear in the release
# package: client subdomains, GTM/container IDs, webhook tokens, internal hostnames.
#
# Format: one literal per line. Blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# The validator matches these as plain substrings (case-sensitive).
#
# The values are secrets, so DO NOT commit the filled-in file. CI can instead pass
# them via the FORBIDDEN_LITERALS env var (newline- or comma-separated).
#
# Examples of the kinds of values to list (replace with your own):
# your-client.bitrix24.ru
# gtm-xxxxxxx-xxxxx
# your-webhook-secret-token
# your-internal-host.example
